WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:04.357
P1.0 · Versions: one per closing

2
00:00:05.507 --> 00:00:09.509
Before reading any statement, look at the first box of the top bar.

3
00:00:09.559 --> 00:00:17.316
It shows the version you are reading: 2026-09, the September 2026 close.

4
00:00:18.466 --> 00:00:24.674
A version keeps the ledger, the statements, the forecast and the KPIs as they stood at that close.

5
00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:28.658
Pick an earlier one and every page shows the situation then.

6
00:00:29.808 --> 00:00:34.251
The Versions row puts several closings side by side, one column each.

7
00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:38.080
Say it in a meeting: these are the figures at the September close.

